s you build powerful automation while maintaining full control over your data and deployments. You can find more information about our Community license in our [License FAQ](https://docs.n8n.io/n8n-community-license/community-license/license-faq) page.\n \n - Check out [our main project here](https://github.com/n8n-io/n8n).\n - Interested in working at n8n? See our [open positions](https://n8n.io/careers)."}]}}